{"id":101,"verses":[{"number":1,"arabicText":"ٱلْقَارِعَةُ","transliteration":"Al-qāriʿat","translation":"The Striking Disaster"},{"number":2,"arabicText":"مَا ٱلْقَارِعَةُ","transliteration":"Mā l-qāriʿat","translation":"What is the Striking Disaster"},{"number":3,"arabicText":"وَمَآ أَدْرَىٰكَ مَا ٱلْقَارِعَةُ","transliteration":"Wamā adrāka mā l-qāriʿat","translation":"And what will make you realize what the Striking Disaster is"},{"number":4,"arabicText":"يَوْمَ يَكُونُ ٱلنَّاسُ كَٱلْفَرَاشِ ٱلْمَبْثُوثِ","transliteration":"Yawma yakūnu n-nāsu kal-farāshi l-mabthūth","translation":"˹It is˺ the Day people will be like scattered moths"},{"number":5,"arabicText":"وَتَكُونُ ٱلْجِبَالُ كَٱلْعِهْنِ ٱلْمَنفُوشِ","transliteration":"Watakūnu l-jibālu kal-ʿih'ni l-manfūsh","translation":"and the mountains will be like carded wool"},{"number":6,"arabicText":"فَأَمَّا مَن ثَقُلَتْ مَوَٰزِينُهُۥ","transliteration":"Fa-ammā man thaqulat mawāzīnuh","translation":"So as for those whose scale is heavy ˹with good deeds˺"},{"number":7,"arabicText":"فَهُوَ فِى عِيشَةٍۢ رَّاضِيَةٍۢ","transliteration":"Fahuwa fī ʿīshatir-rāḍiyatin","translation":"they will be in a life of bliss"},{"number":8,"arabicText":"وَأَمَّا مَنْ خَفَّتْ مَوَٰزِينُهُۥ","transliteration":"Wa-ammā man khaffat mawāzīnuh","translation":"And as for those whose scale is light"},{"number":9,"arabicText":"فَأُمُّهُۥ هَاوِيَةٌۭ","transliteration":"Fa-ummuhu hāwiyatun","translation":"their home will be the abyss"},{"number":10,"arabicText":"وَمَآ أَدْرَىٰكَ مَا هِيَهْ","transliteration":"Wamā adrāka mā hiyah","translation":"And what will make you realize what that is"},{"number":11,"arabicText":"نَارٌ حَامِيَةٌۢ","transliteration":"Nārun ḥāmiyatun","translation":"˹It is˺ a scorching Fire"}]}